// **The owner's 2026-10-03 playtest opening, as a bed**: herbs alone, grown
// for 35,000 frames, then one colony of 52 asked for (the shelf's default
// stock) dropped in the middle. In the playtest 44 seated, fell to 9 by
// frame 100,000, 83 of 124 deaths were starvation, and the first ant was
// born ~40,000 frames after placement
// (`/mnt/project-files/playtest-2026-10-03/findings.md`).
//
// The chronicle does not log where plants or the colony went, so the layout
// is matched by counts, and there are two files because the two readings
// differ: this one keeps the herbs clear of the nest, and
// `herb_first_colony_near` puts them either side of it, which is what the
// playtest's nest band (0 bare cells of 129) and its food (21k J at 40k)
// look like. The near bed is the one that reproduces the starvation.
//
// Read with `labforage scenario=herb_first_colony lifetrace=F
// lifetrace_brood=1 budtrace=G` -- eggs, larvae and each ant's reachable
// room are in the lifetrace (see `labforage.rs`).
(
    name: "herb_first_colony",
    title: "THE FIRST COLONY ON A HERB BED",
    question: "Herbs alone, grown for 35,000 frames, then one colony of ants dropped on them. Who finds food, who eats, who banks enough to lay?",
    bed: (
        width: 512,
        height: 320,
        soil_depth: 80,
        ground_y: 160,
        compartments: 1,
        founders: 0,
        species: "herb",
        colonies: 0,
        colony_ants: 52,
        colony_species: "ant",
        predators: 0,
        lamp_spacing: 33,
        seed: 1,
        extra_walls: [],
    ),
    settings: [],
    placements: [
        // Two herbs, well clear of the nest column. Matched by count, not by
        // position (the playtest does not log where plants went): the owner's
        // chronicle reads 49 / 133 / 182 plants-plus-seeds at 10k / 20k / 30k
        // and 44 ants seated; this reads 43 / 119 / 201 and 42 seated on seed
        // 1 (main 0bc13abb). Eight herbs read 226 at 10k -- five times too
        // dense -- and seated 17.
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 128),
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 384),
    ],
    timeline: [
        (at: 35000, every: 0, until: 0, what: Colony(species: "ant", x: 256, count: 52)),
    ],
    horizon: 100000,
)
